    (instances
      (project "cell_test_bench"
        (path "/d0bd28e9-33ae-4956-909b-7db88648ff33/a600496c-b291-417b-8af7-71c8d87c18c5"
          (reference "#PWR033")
          (unit 1)))))
  (text "Setpoint: PWM from PA6 (TIM3_CH1), filtered by R301/C301 and R302/C302, divided by R303/R304: SETP = PWM x 3.3 V / 27.8 = 0-119 mV."
    (at 25 246.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid ac3434df-f438-4e90-9c51-ac4c58221937))
  (text "CC loop: INP = (SETP - I x 10 mOhm)/2. U301A integrates (R307, C304) until INP equals INN, so I = (SETP - 2 x INN)/10 mOhm. R308 biases INN by +2.5 mV, so PWM = 0 always means zero current."
    (at 25 250.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 88c18523-916e-4c63-b61a-56c973b7a431))
  (text "Full scale about 11.3 A (firmware limits to 10 A). Q301 IRFP260N works in linear mode on the heatsink; the external 0.1 Ohm 50 W resistor (J301) shares the heat."
    (at 25 255.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid cc82e315-b9e9-4832-af8f-1defc6417ae8))
  (text "Load off: LOAD_OFF is pulled up to +5 V (R310) and lifts INN to 0.4 V through D301/R309, so the op-amp output goes to 0 V. The MCU pulls PB14 low (open drain) to enable the load."
    (at 25 259.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 5ed1c329-321a-4d09-99ad-22a24282817f))
  (text "Hardware fault: K4_COIL rises to 12 V when the safety switch drops, and lifts INN through D302/R311. K2 opens a few ms later."
    (at 25 264.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid d1cd2c43-5803-4d57-b48d-596bbb8d62d7))
  (text "U301B: current monitor I_MON = 1.707 V + 0.12 V/A (discharge positive), for the MCU ADC (PA0), the OC comparators and the charger current limit."
    (at 25 268.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid ef920210-9a5f-4276-bdc2-6efae51a3ef0))
  (text "U301 = OPA2171 (SOIC-8, soldered on the copper side). R319/C306/C307 filter the op-amp supply +12VA (also feeds U401). How it works / what to check: docs/SCHEMATIC_GUIDE.md section 3."
    (at 25 273.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 7174fdf7-e92f-4adc-98f4-6123fd99988d)))
